I thought we'd cleared out references to examples.distancesampling.org <http://examples.distancesampling.org> from our documentation - but it looks like we missed some, so we'll get that fixed on the next release.  I'll also see if I can get some kind of forwarding in place for folks visiting http://examples.distancesampling.org/.

Cheers, Len Thomas
